        "en": "Boxed warning: high potential for abuse, misuse and addiction, overdose and death."
      },
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-focalin",
          "section": "Boxed Warning"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": {
        "fa": "خطر در بیماری قلبی جدی؛ افزایش فشار و ضربان؛ عوارض روانی؛ پریاپیسم؛ رینود؛ مهار رشد در کودک؛ گلوکوم؛ تیک.",
        "en": "Risk in serious cardiac disease; raised BP and HR; psychiatric reactions; priapism; Raynaud; growth suppression in children; glaucoma; tics."
      },
